{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "d9e02765ebaa440d7a40608692c6581c35d51a44c254b37128a982a094eac5b3", "ja": "いつかまたあえるよね！", "zh": "总有一天还会再见面吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f5f562e1392f644df381036bf2381ae240f5938ddcce6f814ddc30697b48b246", "ja": "『☆ピコピコプラネット☆』最終回記念＆\nシーズン特番決定のバーベキューを行うアイ\nドル達。雪歩も駆けつけるが、またしても光\nに包まれ消えてしまう。ひなたとプロデュー\nサーは、再会を楽しみに思うのだった。", "zh": "为了纪念《☆PIKO PIKO PLANET☆》播出\n最后一集＆制作季节特别节目，偶像们办了\n烤肉大会。雪步虽然也赶来参加，\n但是她又再次被光芒包围而消失了。\n日向和制作人很期待能再见到她。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d2c69affeb527dc3b130c65d31369987c6e9096beccf99c60518a5946774784d", "ja": "（今日は『☆ピコピコプラネット☆』完結記念の\nお祝いバーベキュー。そして……）", "zh": "（我们今天为了纪念《☆PIKO PIKO PLANET☆》完结，\n举办了庆功烤肉大会，而且……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "4b55603e9494ad295d0a16178ea5d3e6a01a904c252dab11a2d0e075b174573e", "ja": "（最終回の放送終了後、すぐに決まった\nシーズン特番の決起会でもある！）", "zh": "（最后一集播出后，立刻就决定要制作季节特别节目，\n所以今天也是誓师大会！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_07_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "fc34fb36ab016d72a692d72997027e4ad50523572d8e206f20efa66eeb6727b6", "ja": "えへへ♪　また宇宙人になって、子ども達に\n会えるんですよね。うれしいです！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪又可以成为外星人，\n再跟孩子们见面了呢，好开心喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_07_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "1161e96295bc47630fec615485c61a7c402b5b9e1ba872d68cd9b9d60eb4ffa2", "ja": "杏奈、虫も少し……\n平気に、なれた……よ？", "zh": "杏奈也比较……\n不怕虫了……喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_07_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "dc6c983c023bbd4af6ee922e52b839885f3b5e7fe5efcebe2e53ff4582857f2e", "ja": "特番では、どんな『せーふく』をするんだろうねぇ。\n今から楽しみだよぉ。", "zh": "不知道特别节目里会用什么方式『征服』呢～？\n我已经迫不及待了耶～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_07_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "f510a0be552df18a498ae8ec38a37de5ac16801bea0a3f082d32f08cfd5c7c92", "ja": "ねえねえ、おやぶん！\nまた雪歩お姉ちゃんも出られる？", "zh": "欸欸，老大！\n雪步姊姊可以再上节目吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_07_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c7f3244481a583327b5f0d5b0f057af080a377563226ac4e4d66c0899f92f9d9", "ja": "ああ、雪歩のゲスト回は、視聴率もトップ3に入る\n人気回だったからな。……と噂をすれば……", "zh": "可以的，毕竟雪步当特别来宾那一集，是收视率\n进了前三名的人气集数啊……才刚说到她就来了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_07_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "a7f5fdf40084d0fef0aaf99383d63e9c97cc9624d43c7f85a29d137d85280d91", "ja": "あ、雪歩お姉ちゃんだ！　わーい！", "zh": "啊，是雪步姊姊！耶～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_07_1008_004yuk", "source_sha256": "dff9952aebe2a85ad301a3e72b860f121d084f827f5546f015b7b7ba1e5e968d", "ja": "遅れてごめんなさい。\nこれ、差し入れです。", "zh": "对不起我晚来了。\n这是慰劳品。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_07_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "be9831b6f5bc7a1e2dbdabc00acb92338d4880d4d8ffb2045e1afc473fac841c", "ja": "わぁ～、とっても新鮮なお野菜がいっぱいです！\nありがとうございます♪", "zh": "哇～好多新鲜的蔬菜！\n谢谢你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_07_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "6d11e0a1fef8df334e9d754adadcd556507603bfcfc7dc00250632796b58ca0d", "ja": "近くに農家があってよかったです。\n……みんな、私を仲間に入れてくれてありがとう。", "zh": "幸好附近有农家。\n……各位，谢谢你们把我当作伙伴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_07_1011_004yuk", "source_sha256": "122563d6ba30fe7fc34a3183542fe60e6b38230542ab2007f480528f6c06348a", "ja": "みんなが教えてくれた方法で、\n私も周りを『せーふく』したの。", "zh": "我也有用大家教我的方式，\n『征服』了身边的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_07_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f709ca403efca7d1d9dfcd17dbce1901ed2dffce83f9c7d89dc1d1e4eff2951e", "ja": "できたよ、お友達が……\nとってもたくさん！", "zh": "我交到朋友了喔……\n而且交到了很多！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_07_1013_004yuk", "source_sha256": "096e8e7df5c62bac03f2d22322220ef47d174920f317aa0af990164827396267", "ja": "それじゃあ、いつか宇宙のどこかで。\nまた会おうね、ミリオン星の……お友達のみんな！", "zh": "那么，我们以后在宇宙的某个角落相会吧。\n再见啰，百万行星的……各位朋友们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_07_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "ea43afcfbaaed42e0dcbf91fd30cb5ec1069a6376822666f3c408730bbf54f6d", "ja": "あれ！？\n雪歩さん、またいなくなっちゃいました……？", "zh": "奇怪！？\n雪步姊姊又不见了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_07_1015_035hin", "source_sha256": "c93c66f572e68714d5a439e4c5c4489be8eb1a5779dd6f3c9513bdb8d748d500", "ja": "ありゃ～。\nどこに行ってしまったんだろうか……？", "zh": "哎呀～\n她是上哪去了呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_07_1016_se", "source_sha256": "14c468c82099cb5a701b0e8229c722719a6ca26f0e37f00f015878f3d89eae31", "ja": "ガサガサッ", "zh": "（沙沙作响）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_07_1017_004yuk", "source_sha256": "cd77b751d2a90b76e5346c45175961bb14bfae71afa5df33bd1192744c0b5186", "ja": "て、手土産もないのに来てごめんなさい～！\nおはようございますぅ！", "zh": "抱、抱歉我两手空空就来了～！\n大家早安！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_07_1018_040tam", "source_sha256": "1236bc8c1e3d7a5b5b9c070e581443d663cb26d5ea8c4ef4b0de09bc94d7ecef", "ja": "あ、また雪歩お姉ちゃんだぞ！\nねえねえ、今のぱっと消えるやつ、すごいぞ～！", "zh": "啊，雪步姊姊又回来了！\n欸欸，你刚才那个突然消失的招式，很厉害喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_07_1019_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7e6abd6390c30ffe3faa27575c74eed0b6aefccd7c92d1656b6f7da997c9fb00", "ja": "え……消える？　な、何のこと？", "zh": "咦……消失？你、你是指什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_07_1020_040tam", "source_sha256": "d01f2047b043479019d3c444e3f6d5fd8c49f7d5fcb5adafa5700adc65cb7add", "ja": "他にも何かできるの？\nやってやってー！", "zh": "你还会其他招式吗？\n表演一下嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_07_1021_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f44db7d530bdb022ad93475c717674824a6c64c98f242ac812030e0d0ba5f54d", "ja": "な、何かっていわれても……\nうう、なんにもできなくてごめんなさい～！", "zh": "你、你要我表演我也……\n呜呜，对不起我什么都不会～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_07_1022_024ann", "source_sha256": "6a9ca96ecc7313c7587b858adbf4f496b4539973c5996b208b43fd5a9136fc70", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\n雪歩さんって……ふたり、いるの？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n该不会……有两个雪步吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_07_1023_p", "source_sha256": "5d4cb3c1ff0d2f0fcb0f902b335fd9de17c695e07fed7e56d67d5c8c238cab5d", "ja": "……たぶん、雪歩はひとりだと思うよ。\n実はものすごい速さで動けるのかもしれない。", "zh": "……我想应该只有一个雪步吧。\n搞不好她其实会超高速移动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_07_1024_p", "source_sha256": "2c6bd1588297a5b6e7b42f21b82ebc466fbbf2f8e82cbc34ebb6781616582aa1", "ja": "でも、そうじゃないとしたら……。", "zh": "但如果事情并非如此的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_07_1025_p", "source_sha256": "ff0d121a209781d7931d96753a72c79a60c59bb2c8fee5671b958c8c2af96aeb", "ja": "いつか、また会えた時に、\n聞いてみればいいんじゃないかな。", "zh": "那就等未来再见面的时候，\n再问问看她吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_07_1026_035hin", "source_sha256": "996c96e3b7865ef461aa260b465ae6120dc30a78f6347692ea2c4e46317d411e", "ja": "……そうだねぇ。\nあたしは、きっとまた会える気がするよぉ。", "zh": "……说得也是哪～\n我觉得总有一天一定能再见面的喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_07_1027_035hin", "source_sha256": "1a6c5293ac636d39802ad24cac2458c8e770db8054e73a283f49707532560653", "ja": "だって……あたし達のこと、\n友達って言ってくれたからねぇ。えへへ♪", "zh": "因为……她说我们\n是她的朋友啊～嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_07_1028_p", "source_sha256": "0b87e668bb61b7b7062b2abb2371b9e451d13fd1a1125fa68456d77e9c602db4", "ja": "（いつか、この『せーふく』が広がっていって、\n世界中の誰もが手をつなぎあえる日が来たら……）", "zh": "（要是总有一天，我们的『征服』逐渐扩散，\n让全世界的每个人都能手牵着手……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_07_1029_p", "source_sha256": "4003452aa37da69285ea8c7ba27dd56f58a4feefe7ad9a4398e31479b21b728d", "ja": "（それが、本当に本当の、世界『せーふく』って\nやつなのかもしれないな！）", "zh": "（那么，这或许就可以说是\n真正的『征服』世界吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
